{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for aromatherapy sessions that may support calm, focus, and restful moments.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfa;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#7b7b7b;--accent:#2f6b5b;--accent-2:#8dbfae;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius:12px; --shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(16,24,32,0.08);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfbfa 0%,#f3f8f6 100%);color:#0b0b0b}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),rgba(255,255,255,0.5));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.03);z-index:50}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    .nav-links{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:14px}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    main{padding:48px 16px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:22px}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    /* SVG stripe */
    .stripe{height:88px;overflow:hidden}
    .stripe svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px;margin-top:20px}
    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(12,12,12,0.06);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(250,250,250,0.6));}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(12,12,12,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}

    /* Session planner */
    .planner h3{margin-top:0}
    .planner .chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .chip{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f3f7f5;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);cursor:pointer}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .reveal.in-view{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    footer{padding:28px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}

    /* small responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.nav-links{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container" style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding-top:14px;padding-bottom:14px">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
        <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100" height="100" rx="18" fill="url(#g)"/><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#dff3ea"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2f6b5b"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>
        <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="site">
        <a href="/index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/blends.html">Formulas</a>
        <a href="/shop.html">Botanica</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="/about.html">Who We Are</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="/contact.html" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:800">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero reveal" id="hero">
      <div class="stripe" aria-hidden="true">
        <!-- decorative vector pattern -->
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 120" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="lg" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#f6fffa"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e8f6ef"/></linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <path d="M0,60 C150,10 350,110 600,60 C850,10 1050,110 1200,60 L1200,120 L0,120 Z" fill="url(#lg)"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h1>Connect with the practice — scheduling, questions, and a tailored plan</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach out for a one-off consultation, an immersive VIP Day, or a curated short series that may support clearer, calmer moments. Use the planner to sketch a session; export the summary to share when you book.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px">
          <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="ghost" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="contact-area" style="margin-top:26px">
      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <div class="card" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
            <h2 id="contact-heading">Send a note</h2>
            <p class="lead">Prefer quick messages? We'll reply within 48 hours. For booking, include ideal dates and whether you prefer remote or in-person ({{CITY}}, {{STATE}}).</p>
            <form id="contact-form" onsubmit="handleContact(event)">
              <div style="margin-top:12px">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required autocomplete="name">
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:12px">
                <label for="email">Email</label>
                <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email">
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:12px">
                <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" autocomplete="tel">
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:12px">
                <label for="message">Message</label>
                <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you'd like to focus on (mood, sleep, focus), possible timing, and any sensitivities."></textarea>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px">
                <button class="primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
                <button type="button" class="ghost" onclick="window.location='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'">Email</button>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
            <h3>Quick details</h3>
            <p style="margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
            <p style="margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="card planner" aria-labelledby="planner-heading">
          <h3 id="planner-heading">Session Planner</h3>
          <p class="lead">Draft a focused aromatherapy session and export a plaintext summary to include with your booking or to keep for your notes.</p>

          <form id="planner-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); buildPlan();">
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="client-name">Client name</label>
              <input id="client-name" placeholder="First name or initials">
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="focus">Primary focus</label>
              <select id="focus">
                <option>Calm / Anxiety support</option>
                <option>Sleep support</option>
                <option>Focus / Clarity</option>
                <option>Grounding / Resilience</option>
                <option>Energy uplift</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="duration">Session length</label>
              <select id="duration">
                <option value="15">15 minutes — Micro session</option>
                <option value="30" selected>30 minutes — Standard</option>
                <option value="60">60 minutes — Deep work</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label>Preferred scent families</label>
              <div class="chips" id="notes-chips">
                <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="Citrus">Citrus</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="Herbal">Herbal</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="Floral">Floral</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="Resinous">Resinous</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="Woody">Woody</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="intensity">Intensity</label>
              <select id="intensity">
                <option value="low">Low — subtle</option>
                <option value="medium" selected>Medium — balanced</option>
                <option value="high">High — immersive</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="notes">Notes (sensitivities, pets, pregnancy, meds)</label>
              <input id="notes" placeholder="e.g., cat at home, pregnant, sensitive skin" />
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
              <button class="primary" onclick="buildPlan()">Build plan</button>
              <button type="button" class="ghost" onclick="resetPlanner()">Reset</button>
            </div>

            <div id="plan-output" style="margin-top:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:monospace;background:#fbfffb;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;display:none"></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <button id="copy-btn" class="ghost" type="button" onclick="copyPlan()" style="display:none">Copy summary</button>
              <a id="email-plan" class="ghost" style="display:none" href="#">Email plan</a>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">
            <strong>Note:</strong> Recommendations are safety-forward and non-medical. Always patch test and follow dilution guidance. See the FAQ below for safety notes about pets and pregnancy.
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="faq" style="margin-top:20px">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>FAQ — safety and practical notes</h2>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4>Patch tests & dilution</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">Do a patch test for topical blends: dilute essential oils in a carrier oil (commonly 1–3% for most adults) and apply a small amount behind the ear or on inner forearm. Higher sensitivity, older adults, and children will often use lower dilution (0.5–1%).</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4>Pets</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">Some essential oils can be hazardous to animals. Inform us if you have pets and their species; we will recommend pet-safe approaches (diffusion timing, ventilation, or alternative formulas) that may reduce risk.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4>Pregnancy & medical considerations</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">If you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or on medication, tell us before any session. Certain oils are typically avoided in pregnancy; we will choose safer alternatives and follow best-practice guidance. Our work is not a substitute for medical care.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> · <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
        <div style="color:var(--muted)">Prefer a call? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(r=>r.classList.add('in-view'));
        return;
      }
      const obs = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer)=>{
        entries.forEach(e=>{
          if(e.isIntersecting){
            e.target.classList.add('in-view');
            observer.unobserve(e.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      reveals.forEach(r=>obs.observe(r));
    })();

    // Contact form handler (local only - just shows success)
    function handleContact(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'Friend';
      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. Your message is queued. We will reply to ' + (document.getElementById('email').value || '{{EMAIL}}') + '.');
      e.target.reset();
    }

    // Session Planner logic
    (function(){
      const chips = document.querySelectorAll('#notes-chips .chip');
      const selected = new Set();
      chips.forEach(c=>c.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const val = c.dataset.value;
        if(selected.has(val)){ selected.delete(val); c.style.background = '#f3f7f5'; }
        else{ selected.add(val); c.style.background = 'linear-gradient(90deg,#dff3ea,#bfe9d4)'; }
      }));

      window.resetPlanner = function(){
        document.getElementById('planner-form').reset();
        document.getElementById('plan-output').style.display='none';
        document.getElementById('copy-btn').style.display='none';
        document.getElementById('email-plan').style.display='none';
        selected.clear(); chips.forEach(c=>c.style.background='#f3f7f5');
      }

      window.buildPlan = function(){
        const name = document.getElementById('client-name').value || 'Client';
        const focus = document.getElementById('focus').value;
        const duration = Number(document.getElementById('duration').value);
        const intensity = document.getElementById('intensity').value;
        const notes = document.getElementById('notes').value.trim();
        const families = Array.from(selected).join(', ') || 'No preference';

        // dilution guidance basic heuristic
        let dilution = 2; // percent
        if(duration <= 15) dilution = 0.5;
        else if(duration <= 30) dilution = 1.5;
        else dilution = 2.5;
        if(intensity === 'low') dilution = Math.max(0.5, dilution - 0.5);
        if(intensity === 'high') dilution = Math.min(5, dilution + 0.8);

        // suggested base
        const base = (focus.includes('Sleep')||focus.includes('Calm')) ? 'Jojoba or sweet almond' : 'Light fractionated coconut or jojoba';

        // simple formula builder (non-medical, safety-forward)
        const oils = [];
        if(families.includes('Citrus')) oils.push('Sweet orange (top)');
        if(families.includes('Herbal')) oils.push('Lavender (middle)');
        if(families.includes('Floral')) oils.push('Geranium (middle)');
        if(families.includes('Resinous')) oils.push('Frankincense (base)');
        if(families.includes('Woody')) oils.push('Cedarwood (base)');
        if(oils.length===0) oils.push('Lavender (middle)', 'Sweet orange (top)');

        const blend = oils.slice(0,3).map((o,i)=>`${o} — ${Math.round(100/ (i+2))}% of the blend`).join('; ');

        const summary = [
          `Session plan for: ${name}`,
          `Focus: ${focus}`,
          `Length: ${duration} minutes (${intensity})`,
          `Preferred scent families: ${families}`,
          `Notes: ${notes || '—'}`,
          `Suggested carrier: ${base}`,
          `Suggested topical dilution: ~${dilution}% (patch test recommended).`,
          `Suggested simple formula (aromatic composition): ${blend}`,
          '',
          'Safety & next steps:',
          '- Patch test before topical use; reduce dilution for sensitive skin, children, or older adults.',
          '- If pregnant, breastfeeding, or on medication, consult your provider and inform the practitioner before the session.',
          '- If pets are present, follow pet-safe diffusion practices: ventilate, shorter diffusion windows, avoid direct exposure to animals.'
        ].join('\n');

        const out = document.getElementById('plan-output');
        out.textContent = summary;
        out.style.display='block';
        document.getElementById('copy-btn').style.display='inline-block';
        const emailLink = document.getElementById('email-plan');
        emailLink.style.display='inline-block';
        emailLink.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + encodeURIComponent('Session plan for '+name) + '&body=' + encodeURIComponent(summary);
      }

      window.copyPlan = function(){
        const out = document.getElementById('plan-output');
        if(!out || !out.textContent) return;
        const text = out.textContent;
        if(navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText){
          navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>{
            const b = document.getElementById('copy-btn');
            b.textContent = 'Copied'; setTimeout(()=>b.textContent='Copy summary',2000);
          });
        } else {
          // fallback
          const ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select();
          try{ document.execCommand('copy'); alert('Copied'); }catch(e){ alert('Copy not supported'); }
          ta.remove();
        }
      }

    })();

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact Page — aromatherapy-MORE-2026-02-17T17-32-35-433Z-049

This bundle contains the contact page and a short README for the aromatic practice site built with layoutFamily=zen_minimal and voiceFamily=executive_sharp.

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — Full contact page with an interactive "Session Planner" and scroll-triggered reveal effects.
- README.md — This document.

Placeholders to replace in contact.html:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Key features implemented locally (no external libraries or CDNs):
- Scroll-triggered section reveal using IntersectionObserver, with support for "prefers-reduced-motion: reduce". If a visitor prefers reduced motion, the page shows content immediately and skips animations.
- Session Planner widget:
  - Lets users pick focus, duration, intensity, and scent families.
  - Builds a safety-forward session summary (includes suggested carrier, dilution heuristic, and a sample aromatic composition).
  - Exports a plaintext summary visible on the page.
  - Copy-to-clipboard button (uses navigator.clipboard with a fallback).
  - Email link pre-populates an email to {{EMAIL}} with the plan in the body.
- Accessible, lightweight form elements and clear safety language: all guidance uses "may" or advisory wording—no medical claims.

Safety & content notes:
- The FAQ in the contact page includes dilution, patch test, pets, and pregnancy notes as required.
- The planner outputs dilution heuristics and encourages patch testing and disclosure of pregnancy/medication.

Usage:
1. Replace placeholders in contact.html with your business data.
2. Serve the HTML file using any static server or open it in a browser for testing.
3. The copy and email functions work locally; the contact form currently simulates submission with an alert (adapt to your preferred backend as needed).

Design & UX decisions:
- Navigation labels intentionally differ from other site templates: "Offerings", "Formulas", "Botanica", "Plans", "Who We Are", "Reserve", "Connect".
- The Session Planner is embedded on the contact page so visitors can craft a short, shareable summary before booking.
- Visuals are created with inline SVG and gradients—no external images or fonts.

Developer notes:
- To integrate with back-end booking, wire the contact form to your endpoint in handleContact(e).
- The planner offers a simple heuristic for dilution; replace with your clinical guidelines if desired.

License: deliverable for client use. Replace placeholder values before publishing."}
